🚀 Quick Tools Hub
Quick Tools Hub is a free, all-in-one online toolkit that provides quick access to essential utilities like PDF merging, background removal, and image-to-PDF conversion — no login or installation required.

🛠 Tech Stack
Front-End: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
API: remove.bg
Libraries: PDFLib, PDF.js
Development Environment: Visual Studio Code

✨ Features
🔄 PDF Merger/Splitter – Combine or separate PDFs easily
🖼️ Image Background Remover – Remove backgrounds using AI
🖨️ Image to PDF Converter – Convert images into PDFs in one click
📱 Responsive Design – Works desktop
🔐 No Login Required – Privacy-focused, no sign-up needed
⚡ Fast Processing – Tools work instantly in-browser

🧑‍💻 Usage
Open the app in your browser
Select any tool (PDF, Image, etc.)
Upload your file
Download the processed result instantly

🤝 Contributing
We welcome contributions! Please fork the repo and submit a pull request. For suggestions or bugs, open an issue.
